This project builds on Meta's Muse Gadget SDK
(https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
The SDK is not included in this repository: scripts/install.sh clones it at a pinned commit.
musegadget_mac/ble_server_macos.py re-implements the SDK's BlueZ Bluetooth server for macOS
(CoreBluetooth) and reuses the SDK's protocol constants (service and characteristic UUIDs).

The glasses web app uses Meta's Wearables UI Toolkit, installed from npm and not included in
this repository: @wearables-ui-toolkit/mrbd and /foundation are licensed under the Apache License
2.0; @wearables-ui-toolkit/icons is licensed under the Meta Wearables Developer Terms
(https://wearables.developer.meta.com/terms/).

The Muse mascot artwork is not included. tools/make_mascot.py and tools/make_launcher_glyph.py
extract it from the Muse app installed on your own Mac, for your personal use only. The README
screenshots show the mascot from the author's own install.
